DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nAries Spears LIVE at Funny Bone Comedy Club – Omah
	a\nGet ready for a night of non-stop laughs as stand-up comedy powerhouse 
	Aries Spears takes the stage at Funny Bone Comedy Club in Omaha\, Nebraska
	. Known for his razor-sharp wit and explosive energy\, Aries Spears delive
	rs a comedy experience you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, J
	uly 17\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Funny Bone Co
	medy Club – Omaha\nAddress: 710 N 114th St\, Suite 210\, Omaha\, NE 68154\
	nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nTicket Price: $37 – $42 \
	nAbout Aries Spears\nAries Spears is a veteran stand-up comedian and actor
	 best known for his long run on MADtv\, where his uncanny celebrity impres
	sions made him a household name. With decades of experience on stage and s
	creen\, Spears brings a high-energy\, no-holds-barred style to every perfo
	rmance. He has appeared on numerous TV specials and continues to tour nati
	onally to sold-out crowds. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy
	 from a MADtv legend\nHilarious celebrity impressions and sharp observatio
	nal humor\nAn intimate comedy club atmosphere at Omaha’s Funny Bone\nFull 
	bar and dinner menu available\nA night of laughs you’ll be talking about f
	or weeks\n\nVenue Information\nFunny Bone Comedy Club – Omaha is located a
	t 710 N 114th St\, Suite 210 in Omaha\, Nebraska. The club features a full
	 bar and dinner menu\, offering a complete entertainment experience in an 
	intimate setting perfect for live comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets fo
	r the Friday 7:00 PM early show start at $37. Seating is general admission
	. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (res
	ale). \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate li
	nks. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no 
	extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Val
	id photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event
	/aries-spears-live-at-funny-bone-comedy-club-omaha-fri-early/\n\nFrom Come
	dy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/aries-spears-live-at-funny-bone-comedy
	-club-omaha-fri-early/
