SUMMARY:William Montgomery LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DTSTAMP:20260717T070214Z
DTSTART:20260717T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nWilliam M
	ontgomery is a rising star in the stand-up comedy world\, known for his ra
	zor-sharp wit\, relatable storytelling\, and ability to turn everyday obse
	rvations into laugh-out-loud moments. His comedy style blends self-depreca
	ting humor with sharp social commentary\, drawing audiences in with his na
	tural charisma and impeccable timing. \nMontgomery has been making waves o
	n the comedy circuit\, earning rave reviews from fans and critics alike. W
	ith a perfect 5.0 rating on Ticketmaster from fans who’ve seen him live\, 
	he’s quickly becoming one of the most talked-about comedians on the tourin
	g circuit. Fans describe his shows as “incredible\,” “non-stop laughter\,”
	 and “a must-see experience.” \nKnown for his association with the Kill To
	ny podcast universe\, William Montgomery has built a dedicated following w
	ho appreciate his unique voice and fearless approach to comedy. Whether he
	’s riffing on personal experiences or diving into absurdist territory\, Mo
	ntgomery keeps audiences engaged from the first joke to the last. \nEvent 
	Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM (Doors open a
	t 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Caroline Street\, Hou
	ston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nBeverage Policy: 2 Beverage M
	inimum per person inside the showroom\n\nA second show is also available o
	n Friday\, July 17 at 9:15 PM\, and additional shows on Saturday\, July 18
	 at 7:00 PM and 9:15 PM. Check Ticketmaster for all available show times. 
	\nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Houston is one of Houston’s premier comedy c
	lubs\, located in the heart of downtown at 1204 Caroline Street. Part of t
	he nationally recognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\, this intimate venu
	e offers an up-close and personal comedy experience that larger arenas sim
	ply can’t match. \nThe club features a cozy\, club-style atmosphere with e
	xcellent sightlines from every seat. The venue is cashless and accepts VIS
	A\, Mastercard\, American Express\, and Discover. Valet service is availab
	le at most shows\, and surface and garage parking is available nearby with
	 skybridge access from the Green Street garage located on Clay between Mai
	n and Fannin. \nPunch Line Houston is an 18+ venue. Guests should arrive e
	arly — doors open one hour prior to early shows and 30 minutes prior to la
	te shows. The venue enforces a strict no-phone policy inside the showroom\
	, so come ready to be fully present and enjoy the laughs. No large bags or
	 backpacks are permitted. \nWhat to Expect\nWilliam Montgomery’s live show
	 is a high-energy\, laugh-packed experience from start to finish. Fans who
	’ve seen him describe the show as non-stop entertainment\, with Montgomery
	 commanding the stage with confidence and delivering punchlines that hit h
	ard every time. \nExpect a full stand-up set featuring William’s signature
	 blend of personal storytelling\, sharp observational humor\, and crowd in
	teraction. The intimate setting of Punch Line Houston makes this an especi
	ally memorable experience — you’ll feel like you’re part of the show\, not
	 just watching it. \nThis is a solo headlining performance\, giving Montgo
	mery the full stage to showcase his best material. Whether you’re a longti
	me fan or discovering him for the first time\, this show promises to be an
	 unforgettable night of comedy. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $38 – $
	70 (includes fees) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official)
	 and VividSeats (resale). Secure your seats early — William Montgomery sho
	ws sell out fast! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains af
	filiate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps:
	//comedycalendar.com/event/william-montgomery-live-at-punch-line-houston/\
	n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/william-montgomery-live-at-punch-line-
	houston/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\,
	 United States
