DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Shane Gill
	is\nShane Gillis is one of the hottest names in stand-up comedy today. The
	 Pennsylvania native — born and raised in Mechanicsburg\, PA — has become 
	a cultural phenomenon\, selling out arenas and stadiums across the country
	 with his unapologetically bold\, blue-collar humor. His comedy is raw\, h
	onest\, and deeply rooted in the American experience\, resonating with aud
	iences who appreciate comedy that doesn’t pull its punches. \nGillis gaine
	d national attention through his podcast “Matt and Shane’s Secret Podcast”
	 and his stand-up specials\, including “Live in Austin” and “Beautiful Dog
	s” on Netflix. He returned to Saturday Night Live as a host in 2024 to mas
	sive acclaim\, cementing his status as one of the defining comedic voices 
	of his generation. This Lincoln Financial Field show is a homecoming of so
	rts — Gillis performing in his home state of Pennsylvania for one of the b
	iggest comedy events the city has ever seen. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday
	\, July 17\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM \nVenue: Lincoln Financial Field — 1 Lin
	coln Financial Field Way\, Philadelphia\, PA 19148 \nTicket Prices: $30 – 
	$268 (plus fees\; premium suites available) \nAbout Lincoln Financial Fiel
	d\nLincoln Financial Field — affectionately known as “The Linc” — is the i
	conic home of the Philadelphia Eagles and one of the most recognizable spo
	rts and entertainment venues in the United States. Located at 1 Lincoln Fi
	nancial Field Way in South Philadelphia\, the stadium holds approximately 
	69\,000 fans and offers a world-class entertainment experience at every le
	vel. \nThe Linc features multiple concourse levels with food and beverage 
	options\, premium club spaces\, luxury suites\, and state-of-the-art sound
	 and lighting systems. For a comedy show of this scale\, the production wi
	ll be designed to ensure every fan — from the front row to the upper deck 
	— has an incredible experience. The stadium’s massive video boards and sou
	nd system make it one of the most technically impressive venues in the cou
	ntry. \nParking is available in the stadium’s surrounding lots (advance pu
	rchase recommended for major events). The venue is accessible via SEPTA’s 
	Broad Street Line (AT&T Station) and by car via I-95 and I-76. This is a m
	assive event — plan to arrive early and enjoy the full stadium atmosphere.
	 \nWhat to Expect\nThis is not just a comedy show — it’s a historic event.
	 Shane Gillis performing at Lincoln Financial Field represents one of the 
	largest stand-up comedy shows ever staged in Philadelphia. Expect a full e
	vening of Gillis’s signature brand of comedy\, joined by a lineup of speci
	al guests that promises to make this an unforgettable night. \nThe energy 
	of a stadium crowd experiencing live comedy together is unlike anything el
	se in entertainment. Whether you’re a longtime Gillis fan or just looking 
	for the biggest comedy event of the summer\, this show delivers on every l
	evel. Grab your tickets early — this one will sell out. \nTicket Informati
	on\nPrice Range: $30 – $268 (plus applicable fees\; premium suites from $2
	05) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats
	 (resale). This is one of the most anticipated comedy events of 2026 — don
	’t miss it! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com
	/event/shane-gillis-and-special-guests-live-at-lincoln-financial-field/\n\
	nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/shane-gillis-and-special-guests-live-a
	t-lincoln-financial-field/
LOCATION:Lincoln Financial Field\, 1 Lincoln Financial Field Way\, Philadel
	phia\, PA\, 19148\, United States
