SUMMARY:Gary Owen: No Hard Feelings Tour LIVE at The Venetian Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260717T070214Z
DTSTART:20260717T203000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nGary Owen is one of America’s most beloved stand-up comedians — a fea
	rless\, high-energy performer whose no-filter storytelling\, sharp observa
	tions\, and genuine connection with audiences have made him a fan favorite
	 for over two decades. Known as “America’s Funniest Serviceman” from his e
	arly days winning the title at the Navy’s talent competition\, Gary has bu
	ilt a remarkable career in stand-up\, film\, and television. \nBest known 
	for his roles in films like Think Like a Man\, Ride Along\, and Almost Chr
	istmas\, Gary Owen brings the same authenticity and energy to his stand-up
	 that has made him a Hollywood star. His comedy draws from his own life — 
	growing up in Cincinnati\, his experiences in the military\, his family li
	fe\, and his unique perspective as a comedian who has always crossed cultu
	ral boundaries with ease. \nThe No Hard Feelings Tour brings Gary Owen to 
	The Venetian Theatre for two nights — July 17 and 18 — for what promises t
	o be an unforgettable Las Vegas comedy experience. \nEvent Details\n\nDate
	s: Friday\, July 17 & Saturday\, July 18\, 2026\nTime: 8:30 PM\nVenue: The
	 Venetian Theatre at The Venetian Resort\nAddress: 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd\,
	 Las Vegas\, NV 89109\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Venetian Theatre at The Vene
	tian Resort is one of Las Vegas’s most celebrated entertainment venues\, l
	ocated inside the iconic Venetian Resort at 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd. Seating
	 approximately 1\,800 guests\, the theater is known for its elegant design
	\, excellent acoustics\, and the intimate atmosphere that makes every perf
	ormance feel special. \nThe Venetian Theatre has hosted some of the bigges
	t names in comedy and entertainment\, and its mid-size format makes it the
	 perfect venue for a high-energy stand-up show like Gary Owen’s No Hard Fe
	elings Tour. Every seat offers a great view of the stage\, and the venue’s
	 warm atmosphere ensures a fantastic crowd experience. \nValet and self-pa
	rking are available at The Venetian Resort. The resort offers world-class 
	dining\, shopping\, and casino entertainment\, making it easy to turn a Ga
	ry Owen show into a full Las Vegas night out. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a 
	solo stand-up performance by Gary Owen featuring material from his No Hard
	 Feelings Tour. The show runs approximately 75–90 minutes and features Gar
	y’s signature high-energy comedy — hilarious stories about life\, family\,
	 relationships\, and the world around us\, delivered with the warmth and a
	uthenticity that have made him one of the most beloved comedians working t
	oday. \nGary Owen’s live shows are known for their incredible energy and t
	he deep bond he builds with his audience. He has a rare ability to make ev
	eryone in the room feel included and seen — his comedy is both brilliantly
	 funny and genuinely heartfelt. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $74 – $
	250 \nTickets available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (re
	sale). Grab your seats before they sell out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tick
	ets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/gary-owen-no-hard-feelings-tour-ve
	netian-theatre-las-vegas-july/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/gary-owen-no-hard-feelings-tour-veneti
	an-theatre-las-vegas-july/
