DTSTAMP:20260717T070214Z
DTSTART:20260717T214500Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nAries Spears LIVE at Funny Bone – Omaha\nGet ready
	 for a night of non-stop laughs as stand-up comedy powerhouse Aries Spears
	 takes the stage at Funny Bone Comedy Club in Omaha\, Nebraska. Known for 
	his razor-sharp wit and explosive energy\, Aries Spears delivers a comedy 
	experience you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 202
	6\nTime: 9:45 PM (Doors open at 9:00 PM)\nVenue: Funny Bone Comedy Club\, 
	710 N 114th St\, Suite 210\, Omaha\, NE 68154\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid
	 photo ID required)\nTicket Price: $37 – $42 \nAbout Aries Spears\nAries S
	pears is a veteran stand-up comedian and actor best known for his long run
	 on MADtv\, where his uncanny celebrity impressions made him a household n
	ame. With decades of experience on stage and screen\, Spears brings a high
	-energy\, no-holds-barred style to every performance. He has appeared on n
	umerous TV specials and continues to tour nationally to sold-out crowds. \
	nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a MADtv legend\nHilari
	ous celebrity impressions and sharp observational humor\nAn intimate comed
	y club atmosphere\nFull bar and dinner menu available\nA late-night show p
	erfect for night owls who love to laugh\n\nTicket Information\nTickets for
	 the Friday 9:45 PM late show start at $37. Seating is general admission. 
	\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. W
	e earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra 
	cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid pho
	to ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/aries
	-spears-live-at-funny-bone-comedy-club-omaha-fri-late/\n\nFrom Comedy Cale
	ndar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/aries-spears-live-at-funny-bone-comedy
	-club-omaha-fri-late/
LOCATION:Funny Bone Comedy Club – Omaha\, 710 N 114th St Suite 210\, Omaha\
	, NE\, 68154
